- op: discuss  # 82c6
  at: '2026-07-02T15:41:14Z'  # 82c6
  by: agent  # 82c6
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 82c6
  clock: 4  # 82c6
  nonce: 82c6  # 82c6
  message: "Stale/already-fixed. Filed claim (2026-06-07): WebSocket detection emits references/calls edges with raw meta.channel=/ws instead of event_publishes, bypassing the channel_kind discriminator. Re-verified on merged dev: grep for the channel key in linkers/websocket.py = 0 hits; WS sends emit edge_type=event_publishes with meta.channel_kind=websocket (meta.channel now carries the event TOPIC, the correct conduit referent), endpoint refs carry meta.ref_construct=websocket_endpoint with NO raw meta.channel. Fixed by WI-pozom (173e539114, 2026-06-30) de-overloading edge.meta.channel to the single conduit referent. A consumer filtering event_publishes where channel_kind==websocket now finds WS channels."  # 82c6
